# Personal learning artifacts - local-only, not shared.
# `learning/` consolidates LEARNINGS.md + interview prep + follow-up
# blog ideas + private reference exports (Miro PDFs etc.). The
# top-level `LEARNINGS.md` entry is kept as a safety-net in case any
# session writes back to the historical location before migration.
learning/
LEARNINGS.md

# Eval run artifacts - regenerated per run, baselines.md is the curated record
evals/reports/
.deepeval*

# Claude Code per-checkout state - scheduled-task lock, local settings,
# and project-scoped subagents (the Playwright pw-* team). The repo is
# public, so these stay OUT of git and live only in each maintainer's
# local checkout. (They were briefly tracked in #377; removed in #380.)
.claude/

# macOS Finder artefacts - created automatically whenever a folder is
# opened in Finder. Ignore both top-level and nested to catch them
# wherever Finder drops one.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
